OBJECT OBJ

   Use 'shape obj <obj vnum>' to edit an object. To make a new object, pick
a free vnum in the zone's range and shape it by number: the editor creates
it, and /save writes it into the zone file. The zone file must already
exist. Try /0 for the field list and /help for the editor commands.
'new', /add <file> and /delete are disabled.

Use 'MAN SHAPE OBJ <number>' to obtain help on /<number> command.

See also: MAN WIZ REGISTER
