"MOB"
   Use 'shape mob <mob vnum>' to edit a mob. Zone files are made outside
the game: if the file has no mob with that vnum yet, a blank one is started
with that number and /save puts it in the file. 'shape mob new <zone>',
/new, /add <file>, /delete and 'shape recalc_mobile' are disabled.

The editor opens in simple mode; /simple switches between simple and
extended. /0 lists the fields; a word such as /help lists the commands.
Type the field number on one line and the value on the next.
Blank keeps the current value. /done stops if the save fails.

The default values are given by /recalculate (at least /recalc) from the
level. Use 'help SHAPE MOB <number>' for /<number> in the simple interface,
and 'help SHAPE MOB2 <number>' in the extended interface.
